5,1,1,talk,May,,We need to stop just letting whoever gets there first decide the room's fate. I'll check the fortnight's tally of use by person and the final clear-out of the old fridge.,"{""words"":31,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Misaki,,I'm more concerned about the noise and the mess leaking into the office. I'll look into the partition wall to the office and crumbs and bins at the desks.,"{""words"":29,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Servas,,It is wise to consider the hidden costs of our time and effort. I will examine the facilities callouts on this floor and the round trip for a hot lunch.,"{""words"":30,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Sakura,,I want to see the actual money we're spending! I'll check the invoices for outside hire by the hour and the quotes for the two fit-outs.,"{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Kenji,,I feel like we've all become strangers. I'll look into the unplanned talk since the refit and where the last awkward conversation happened.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
