20,2,,status,Sakura,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
21,2,,status,Servas,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
22,2,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
23,2,,status,May,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":4,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
24,2,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
25,2,1,talk,May,,"It's a total mess. Only two people are using the room most of the time, and the fridge cleaning always falls on one person.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
26,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"The wall is basically paper; I can hear everything. Plus, people are eating at their desks and leaving crumbs everywhere.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
27,2,1,talk,Servas,,"Walking for lunch takes nearly half an hour, which is a significant drain on our day. Interestingly, the store room has had zero callouts.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
28,2,1,talk,Sakura,,"We spent 68,000 yen on tiny outside rooms last year! Also, a meeting setup is more expensive than a kitchen setup.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
29,2,1,talk,Kenji,,"We have no place for private talks. The last awkward conversation happened right in front of everyone, and now we barely talk.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
30,2,2,talk,May,,"@Misaki, if people are eating at their desks, maybe we actually need a proper place to do it?","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
31,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"@May, but if it's a kitchen, the smell and noise will just get worse for those of us sitting right next to the door.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
32,2,2,talk,Servas,,"If we had a kitchen, we would save that twenty-five minute round trip for lunch. That is a lot of vitality wasted.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Servas, but who is going to clean it? May mentioned the fridge was a disaster.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Servas"",""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,2,2,talk,Kenji,,"A kitchen is nice, but it doesn't solve the problem of us being strangers or having nowhere for serious discussions.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,2,3,talk,May,,"@Sakura, that's the problem. We need a system, not just a room.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,3,talk,Misaki,,I just want the crumbs and the loud phone calls to stop. A quiet space sounds like heaven.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,3,talk,Servas,,"A quiet room is peaceful, but it does not address the hunger or the time spent walking.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,3,talk,Sakura,,I'm looking at these invoices and we are bleeding money on outside hires for small meetings.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,3,talk,Kenji,,Exactly! We need a place where we can actually talk without the whole office listening in.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,4,talk,May,,"So we're torn between eating, sleeping, and talking.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,4,talk,Misaki,,I'm leaning towards something that reduces the chaos.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,4,talk,Servas,,We must balance the physical needs with the mental peace of the office.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,4,talk,Sakura,,We just can't keep paying for outside rooms. It's a waste.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,4,talk,Kenji,,I really think the social health of the team is the biggest issue here.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,3,,status,Sakura,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":1,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
46,3,,status,Servas,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":2,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
47,3,,status,Misaki,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":3,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
