49,3,,status,Kenji,,ALIVE,"{""seat"":5,""role"":""PARTICIPANT"",""alive"":true}"
50,3,1,talk,May,,"Option A is the kitchen, B is the quiet room, and C is the meeting space. I'm against A because of the cleaning nightmare.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,3,1,talk,Misaki,,Option B would solve the noise and the crumbs at the desks. I'm voting for the Quiet Room.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,3,1,talk,Servas,,"Option A would save us the long walks for lunch, but the upkeep is a concern. I prefer the stability of Option C.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,3,1,talk,Sakura,,"Option C stops the outside hire costs, though it's the most expensive fit-out. I vote for Meeting Space.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,3,1,talk,Kenji,,Option C is the only one that gives us a place for those awkward or important talks. I'm voting C.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
55,3,2,talk,May,,"@Kenji, if it's a bookable meeting space, does that mean we can't just pop in to chat?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Kenji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
56,3,2,talk,Misaki,,"@Sakura, if we spend 141,000 yen on a screen, will people actually use it for meetings or just for movies?","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
57,3,2,talk,Servas,,"@Misaki, a quiet room is a luxury, but a meeting space is a utility.","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
58,3,2,talk,Sakura,,"@May, a calendar system is better than the ""first come, first served"" chaos you hated.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
59,3,2,talk,Kenji,,It's better than talking by the printer! I'm sticking with C.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
60,3,3,talk,May,,I guess a calendar is fairer than the current system. I'll vote for C.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
61,3,3,talk,Misaki,,"I still hate the noise, but if C means the talking stays inside the room, I can accept it.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
62,3,3,talk,Servas,,It seems the consensus is shifting toward the most professional use of the space.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
63,3,3,talk,Sakura,,It's the only way to justify the budget and stop the outside payments.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
64,3,3,talk,Kenji,,I'm glad we agree. We need to stop being strangers.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
65,3,4,pass,May,,Over,"{""forced"":false,""empty"":false}"
66,3,4,talk,Misaki,,I'll change my vote to C then.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
